        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**KEEP**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**REPLACE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**LET GO OF**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Content & Presentation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[KeyDesign Addon](https://wordpress.org/plugins/keydesign-addon/) & [WPBakery Page Builder](https://wpbakery.com/): Drag & drop layout builder for WordPress"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Replace(?) Sounds like this is Wordpress specific. Do we need something like this for Webflow?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[Slider Revolution](https://www.sliderrevolution.com/): Slideshow builder for key programs, testimonials, and impact statistics"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Not sure what this is. Design related?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[Typing Effect](https://wordpress.org/plugins/animated-typing-effect/): Creates animated text effects"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Not sure what this is. Design related?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[ClassyPress PRO by Mittun](https://mittun.com/classypress/): A theme framework specifically designed for nonprofits, helping present NewRoot's mission and programs effectively"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- ***Is there something for Givesmart? Will we need to have their plugin? (Kelly question)***"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Events & Community Engagement:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[Blocks for Eventbrite](https://wordpress.org/plugins/eventbrite-blocks/): Integrates their professional development workshops and training events directly into the website"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Sounds like this is an integration with Eventbrite when we have workshops so I think we’ll need to keep this one.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[Contact Form 7](https://wordpress.org/plugins/contact-form-7/) & [WP Forms](https://wpforms.com/): Powers various contact forms for program inquiries, partnership requests, and newsletter signups"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **We’ll need to keep this or have something in Webflow with this functionality**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[Popup Maker](https://wordpress.org/plugins/popup-maker/): Creates targeted pop-ups for important announcements, workshop registrations, or resource downloads"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Not sure how this is currently being used on our website**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **I’m 99% sure this is for the NewRoot check-in prompt that pops up to ask how you’re feeling today**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[WP-FormAssembly](https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-formassembly/): Likely used for more complex forms like program ****applications or impact assessment surveys"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **I know we are still using FormAssembly but not sure in what capacity or if it needs to be integrated with the new website**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **I think this could be used for Salesforce integration / at one point we were going to put the forms onto the website as a private page for staff to enter their data**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Membership & E-commerce:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[MemberPress Basic](https://memberpress.com/): Manages access to exclusive educational resources and training materials for partner schools"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Potential alternatives for Webflow:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- [**MemberStack**](https://www.memberstack.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Best for: **Webflow-native membership management**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Pros:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Fully integrates with Webflow UI"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Custom dashboards for members"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Stripe-based payments for subscriptions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Cons:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- No built-in email marketing or CRM (would need Zapier or another integration)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- [**Outseta**](https://www.outseta.com/webflow?utm_source=chatgpt.com)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Best for: **All-in-one membership management (login + payments + email)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Pros:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Built-in **CRM, email marketing, and payments**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- No-code integration with Webflow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Cons:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Not as flexible in UI customization as MemberStack"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- [**MemberSpace**](https://university.webflow.com/integrations-type/memberships?utm_source=chatgpt.com)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Best for: **Simple membership gating**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Pros:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Can restrict access to Webflow pages"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Integrates with existing login providers (like Google)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Cons:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Not as customizable as MemberStack"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-61",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[WooCommerce](https://woocommerce.com/): Handles any paid resources, workshop registrations, or training materials"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- *Do we need this AND Eventbrite for events? Do we want the ability to sell products via our website?*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Media & Content Enhancement:"
