        {
          "id": "b-69",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[Smush](https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-smushit/): Optimizes images while maintaining quality, essential for showing impactful photos of their work"
